  "readmeFile": "ReadMe.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0.1 - WebDownloader: optional CancellationToken and inactivity timeout on Download and DownloadAsync; an interrupted download deletes the partial file. Assemblies compiled against 2.0.0 that call WebDownloader must be recompiled.\n\n2.0.0 - Breaking changes, see README for details and migration notes.\n- PasswordHash/PasswordHelper: PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 with 600,000 iterations, 49-byte versioned hashes and constant-time comparison; 1.x hashes (36 bytes) are still verified and flagged by RequiresRehash.\n- Logging: until LogPath is assigned, SimpleLogger, SimpleLog and CSVLogger follow Paths.DefaultLogsDirectory; DEBUG/PROTOCOL labels in DebugWrite/ProtocolWrite lines; ConditionalLog with independent console and file thresholds.\n- PropertyStringUtils uses its CultureInfo (default CurrentCulture) instead of the thread culture; an invalid string leaves nullable fields unchanged.\n- JsonSettings.Load uses DefaultSerializerOptions; backup names without double dot.\n- NetUtils.CheckDNS returns Reachable false for unknown hosts; EmbeddedResourcesUtils throws InvalidOperationException for a missing resource; DaysOfWeekParameter throws ArgumentOutOfRangeException; CSVLogItem writes null values as \"\".\n- OSKIsNumeric returns bool, SimpleLog.ConsoleLog is static, IPAddressExtensionMethods.TryParseMatch(string, out IPAddress) is obsolete.\n- Bug fixes in ODBC connection string, GCUtils, Paths, PagingCollection, StringUtils, IniFileHelper and WebDownloader; thread-safe PasswordObfuscator and OSKRandom.Shared.",
